{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/50e47697d0baeac62d2f0658e294fc89.avif?t=1750757724\" width=647 height=104 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >OCCT (OverClock Checking Tool) is the best software for testing system stability, diagnosing hardware issues, and monitoring performance. Whether you're an overclocking enthusiast, a technician, or just want to ensure your PC is running smoothly, OCCT provides a powerful suite of tools to push your hardware to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/39b7abced2eb188601d56694d01fda75.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/3ca311a6435efec68afd2b4c1dfd54f5.webp?t=1750757724\" width=646 height=29 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Processor (CPU)</strong> \u2013 Evaluate your CPU\u2019s stability and performance with various test modes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Graphics Card (GPU)</strong> \u2013 Push your GPU to its limits with DirectX and CUDA-specific stress tests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Memory (RAM)</strong> \u2013 Detect potential errors by putting your RAM under heavy load.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power Supply (PSU)</strong> \u2013 Simulate extreme power consumption to assess PSU reliability</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3515100/extras/a8ea2bcd5ded190a6b6ba774484892ae.poster.avi